# Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" and JetBrains HTTP Client. Start the server first: brkit serve
@base = http://127.0.0.1:9292

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Validate a CPF
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cpf/validate?cpf=529.982.247-25

### ...with the checksum steps (what the playground animates)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cpf/validate?cpf=529.982.247-25&explain=true

### Alphanumeric CNPJ
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cnpj/validate?cnpj=12.ABC.345/01DE-35&explain=true

### Reproducible generation: the same seed, the same values
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cpf/generate?uf=SP&count=3&seed=7&formatted=true

### Test card
GET {{base}}/api/v1/card/generate?brand=visa&seed=1

### Legacy plate to Mercosul
GET {{base}}/api/v1/plate/convert?plate=ABC-1234

### Build a PIX BR Code
POST {{base}}/api/v1/pix/payload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "123e4567-e12b-12d1-a456-426655440000",
  "name": "Fulano de Tal",
  "city": "BRASILIA",
  "amount": 12.5,
  "txid": "PED123"
}

### Decode it, with the CRC steps
POST {{base}}/api/v1/pix/decode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": "00020126580014br.gov.bcb.pix0136123e4567-e12b-12d1-a456-4266554400005204000053039865802BR5913Fulano de Tal6008BRASILIA62070503***63041D3D",
  "explain": true
}

### A fictitious person
GET {{base}}/api/v1/fake/person?count=1&seed=7

### An error (problem details)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cpf/generate?count=500

### The OpenAPI document
GET {{base}}/api/v1/openapi.json
